{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_64","type":"agent_message","text":"The aligned layout improved the full suite to 1.03–1.09× with exact equality. I have one verifier run left. Before using it, I’m checking a bounded padding trick for the lone near-aligned ragged case (M=1796): padding its column-major leading dimension to 2048 may unlock rocBLAS’s faster aligned algorithm even after computing the discarded rows."}}
